                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06f0c496-8877-3150-b267-a99138e18fea",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the necessary powers or the needed resources to accomplish a task."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3268e49-d33f-4630-ae20-e450e3279431",
                                                "sense_id": "06f0c496-8877-3150-b267-a99138e18fea",
                                                "text": "She is able to lift the box without assistance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a331e8d2-2d71-3d2b-8aca-46f5d415b11f",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Free from constraints preventing completion of task; permitted to; not prevented from."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32a7cb9e-cea9-4720-abc6-9a29548f04bb",
                                                "sense_id": "a331e8d2-2d71-3d2b-8aca-46f5d415b11f",
                                                "text": "In a democratic world you'd be able to say what you thought wherever you were."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2ede18e-d577-4b78-bcf4-30075b68c973",
                                                "sense_id": "a331e8d2-2d71-3d2b-8aca-46f5d415b11f",
                                                "text": "I'll see you as soon as I'm able."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23a5f3d4-bae4-4256-8a9d-57547368d8c5",
                                                "sense_id": "a331e8d2-2d71-3d2b-8aca-46f5d415b11f",
                                                "text": "With that obstacle removed, I am now able to proceed with my plan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89787efc-72f6-38a8-b9fa-43916b171e30",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gifted with skill, intelligence, knowledge, or competence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "966a7ca5-062b-4806-8de4-b0fd8dc22e8c",
                                                "sense_id": "89787efc-72f6-38a8-b9fa-43916b171e30",
                                                "text": "The chairman was also an able sailor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5003b941-f8fb-4766-a15e-43073442fef5",
                                                "sense_id": "89787efc-72f6-38a8-b9fa-43916b171e30",
                                                "text": "Natures that haue much Heat, and great and violent deſires and Perturbations, are not ripe for Action, till they haue paſſed the Meridian of their yeares: As it was with Iulius Cæſar, and Septimius Seuerus. […] And yet he [Septimus Severus] was the Ableſt Emperour, almoſt, of all the Liſt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ad7d738-83b9-485a-90c0-21dbf621c990",
                                                "sense_id": "89787efc-72f6-38a8-b9fa-43916b171e30",
                                                "text": "Urania speaks with darken’d brow:\n⁠‘Thou pratest here where thou art least;\n⁠This faith has many a purer priest,\nAnd many an abler voice than thou: […]’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aebff6ff-0895-387f-b005-dc375e0f711a",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Legally qualified or competent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "218aa3f9-27c2-4370-9c74-6b69862f0638",
                                                "sense_id": "aebff6ff-0895-387f-b005-dc375e0f711a",
                                                "text": "He is able to practice law in six states."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90c51b85-98f4-32f8-80aa-fdfb7de95869",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of performing all the requisite duties; as an able seaman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1b1319a-6987-3946-86c0-442c10d92fa1",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the physical strength; robust; healthy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dialectal",
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed467b22-0803-4c76-9203-8f14a2363201",
                                                "sense_id": "d1b1319a-6987-3946-86c0-442c10d92fa1",
                                                "text": "After the past week of forced marches, only half the men are fully able."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e10506d-4dba-3eeb-b6e0-44ffa2403ea0",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Easy to use."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0259c77c-f01f-44cc-9811-e9aed34a1a26",
                                                "sense_id": "3e10506d-4dba-3eeb-b6e0-44ffa2403ea0",
                                                "text": "As the hands are the most habil parts of the body..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c950f30d-c915-363a-9b32-4bf4c0ee9d2c",
                                        "entry_id": "88a464fd-82a4-3d71-aa69-6660a5e759db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suitable; competent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24793782-1ff9-4579-a96e-0830bbf7b22e",
                                                "sense_id": "c950f30d-c915-363a-9b32-4bf4c0ee9d2c",
                                                "text": "[…] and for every able man servant that he or she shall carry or send armed and provided as aforesaid, ninety acres of land of like measure."
